Hi Helen,

Sometimes this happens if you save your sumstats output to use later, and then R adds a random column (typically labeled V1 or X). This will offset things in a way that causes the sort of error you are seeing. I would just check the colnames on the sumstats piece, and then remove that extra variable if that is the issue. If that does not seem to be the issue could you post the code you ran here (feel free to remove exact variable names).

